  "description": "Convenience meta-package for the LogicalOptimizer toolkit. It contains no code: it depends on the LogicalOptimizer facade, LogicalOptimizer.Dnnf and LogicalOptimizer.Formats so a single `dotnet add package LogicalOptimizer.Full` pulls in every managed package (optimizer, SAT, BDD, minimization, d-DNNF knowledge compilation and DIMACS/WCNF/OPB import/export). Modular users can keep referencing the individual layer packages instead.",
